SPIM 9.1.24 output (test data only)
  Copyright (c) 1990-2023, James R. Larus. All rights reserved.
  License: BSD 3-Clause (text in tests/spim-oracle/LICENSE)
  Source:  https://sourceforge.net/projects/spimsimulator/ (Subversion r764)
  No SPIM code is in this repository or in any distributed program. The
  command-line assembler hcs-asm (native/hcs-asm/) and the vendored SPIM
  source (vendor/spim-9.1.24/) were removed (D-141): programs are
  assembled in Hallym MIPS and loaded as executable images (.hmx). What
  remains is output that SPIM produced before the removal, kept as test
  data: disassembler goldens (tests/disasm/, including listings of SPIM's
  own helloworld.s and Tests/tt.core.s), run, listing and memory-layout
  oracles (tests/spim-oracle/, tests/hmx/hallym-mips-v2.4.0/*.regs),
  hcs-asm output (tests/asm/*.json) and test images (tests/hmx/asm/,
  tests/hmx/mips/, tests/hmx/record/) whose start-up code comes from
  SPIM's exceptions.s.
  Location: tests/ (test data only; not part of the distributed program)

